{"id":"0b91495e20376554","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-cfg-useless-symbol-elimination.md","title":"先生成性、后可达性的约简","display":"thm-cfg-useless-symbol-elimination — 先生成性、后可达性的约简","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-cfg-useless-symbol-elimination","aliases":["73-thm-cfg-useless-symbol-elimination"],"display":"thm-cfg-useless-symbol-elimination — 先生成性、后可达性的约简","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-generating-variables]]","[[73-df-cfg-reachable-variables]]","[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]","[[73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§7.1, print pp. 261–275; PDF pp. 283–297; local effective construction","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorem 4.2 and Example 4.8, pp. 89–90; scans 97–98","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":7},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-cfg-useless-symbol-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-cfg-useless-symbol-elimination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cfg-useless-symbol-elimination — 先生成性、后可达性的约简"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"52e38b01446c4422\" href=\"?note=52e38b01446c4422\" title=\"73-df-cfg-generating-variables\">73-df-cfg-generating-variables</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bb21416dea99a4c\" href=\"?note=8bb21416dea99a4c\" title=\"73-df-cfg-reachable-variables\">73-df-cfg-reachable-variables</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"97562bc4aa1d6014\" href=\"?note=97562bc4aa1d6014\" title=\"73-df-cfg-generated-language\">73-df-cfg-generated-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a01cd76e5cbb0051\" href=\"?note=a01cd76e5cbb0051\" title=\"73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness\">73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§7.1, print pp. 261–275; PDF pp. 283–297; local effective construction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 4.2 and Example 4.8, pp. 89–90; scans 97–98"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(G)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(L(G)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。生成性与可达性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"52e38b01446c4422\" href=\"?note=52e38b01446c4422\" title=\"73-df-cfg-generating-variables\">73-df-cfg-generating-variables</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8bb21416dea99a4c\" href=\"?note=8bb21416dea99a4c\" title=\"73-df-cfg-reachable-variables\">73-df-cfg-reachable-variables</a>；语义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"97562bc4aa1d6014\" href=\"?note=97562bc4aa1d6014\" title=\"73-df-cfg-generated-language\">73-df-cfg-generated-language</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a01cd76e5cbb0051\" href=\"?note=a01cd76e5cbb0051\" title=\"73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness\">73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}useless\\text{-}symbol\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\nV_1\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Generating}(G),\\quad P_1\\coloneqq P\\cap(V_1\\times(V_1\\cup\\Sigma)^*),\\quad G_1\\coloneqq(V_1,\\Sigma,P_1,S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}useless\\text{-}symbol\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\nV_1\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Generating}(G),\\quad P_1\\coloneqq P\\cap(V_1\\times(V_1\\cup\\Sigma)^*),\\quad G_1\\coloneqq(V_1,\\Sigma,P_1,S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}useless\\text{-}symbol\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\nV_2\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ReachVar}(G_1),\\quad P_2\\coloneqq P_1\\cap(V_2\\times(V_2\\cup\\Sigma)^*),\\quad G_2\\coloneqq(V_2,\\Sigma,P_2,S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}useless\\text{-}symbol\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\nV_2\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ReachVar}(G_1),\\quad P_2\\coloneqq P_1\\cap(V_2\\times(V_2\\cup\\Sigma)^*),\\quad G_2\\coloneqq(V_2,\\Sigma,P_2,S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}useless\\text{-}symbol\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\nG_1,G_2\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\land L(G_2)=L(G)\\land\\operatorname{Generating}(G_2)=V_2\\land\\operatorname{ReachVar}(G_2)=V_2\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}useless\\text{-}symbol\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\nG_1,G_2\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\land L(G_2)=L(G)\\land\\operatorname{Generating}(G_2)=V_2\\land\\operatorname{ReachVar}(G_2)=V_2\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非空性保证 S 留在第一步。任一成功推导只使用可生成变量；第二步只保留可达产生式，且从可达的可生成变量导出终结词的推导不会经过不可达变量，所以两种性质同时成立。顺序颠倒可能重新产生不可达变量；第三版 §7.1.1, pp.262–264 讨论了该顺序问题。固定 Σ 中未出现的终结字符允许保留，这是固定字母表的本地版本；第三版完整 CNF 还会删除无用终结符，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8fdba87feab50061\" href=\"?note=8fdba87feab50061\" title=\"73-df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf\">73-df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-generating-variables","status":"resolved","id":"52e38b01446c4422","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-generating-variables]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-reachable-variables","status":"resolved","id":"8bb21416dea99a4c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-reachable-variables]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-generated-language","status":"resolved","id":"97562bc4aa1d6014","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness","status":"resolved","id":"a01cd76e5cbb0051","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-cfg-fixed-point-correctness]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-generating-variables","status":"resolved","id":"52e38b01446c4422","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$ 且 $L(G)\\ne\\varnothing$。生